MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7d2a9460aae1c4420a415466d1db880f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 14
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dossamer.Dialogue.Schema.Cutscene
  Title: 1-4
  Exchanges:
  - Lines:
    - Text: Due to incompetence of the human mind, the company leadership assigned
        a quota of 80% surface cleaning for all non-robotic janitor employees.
      Guid:
        Value: 6527ddb5-e2bd-4044-bfc8-ec4bbf2ab5a7
    - Text: Failure to meet such a quota will result in access decline of all floor's
        exits until it is met or the expiration of the janitor unit.
      Guid:
        Value: 5cdb7983-8cb6-4450-8189-8c1206efa58c
    - Text: '[CLEAN AT LEAST 80% OF THE DIRT ON THE LEVEL TO UNLOCK THE EXIT. YOU
        CAN SEE YOUR PROGRESS ON THE BOTTOM RIGHT OF THE SCREEN]'
      Guid:
        Value: 3445fd4f-9c49-425e-8856-2712f4f628b0
    Speaker: AdminAI
    Guid:
      Value: d317a812-954a-41cf-90bc-447256191753
  - Lines:
    - Text: Speaking of incompetence, I don't think I can really stop my board once
        I start moving, but maybe I can turn around with those pipes over there?
      Guid:
        Value: 370b99db-9b14-4a39-b284-09aaf2f49a49
    - Text: "And that Constructor\u2122 liquid on those walls! I used to jump around
        on it as a kid and it's impossible to clean..."
      Guid:
        Value: ba9c9ac8-63e0-4277-b46b-2119975c5c22
    - Text: The elevator may be out of service, but I found my way up.
      Guid:
        Value: d7aa86b2-bab3-458a-9891-112021214a07
    - Text: '[USE PIPES TO TURN AROUND, PRESS SPACE WHILE ON STICKY WALLS TO PERFORM
        WALL JUMPS THAT ALSO TURN YOU AROUND]'
      Guid:
        Value: daea12cd-0a4e-49aa-a623-16ebcf9c8dfb
    Speaker: The Janitor
    Guid:
      Value: 2e704674-3ad3-45ec-8d44-57bd11450cb8
  Guid:
    Value: a713723a-83b9-412f-8267-367f77303fd3
